---
import HarnessMark from "../HarnessMark.astro"
import Icon from "../Icon.astro"
import "../../styles/app-theme.css"
---

<div class="split app-theme" role="img" aria-label="Session tabs across the top, Claude Code running in a terminal tab, and a Codex chat beside it">
  <div class="app-card terminal">
    <div class="tabs"><span class="session"><span class="tab-mark"><HarnessMark name="codex" /></span>Fix usage meter</span><span class="active"><Icon name="terminal" />claude</span><span><Icon name="terminal" />codex</span></div>
    <div class="screen">
      <p><b>✦ Claude Code</b> <span class="muted">v2.1.247</span></p>
      <p>Opus 5 (1M context) · high effort</p>
      <p class="path">~/claxedo</p>
      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <p>❯ trace why the session list flickers on reconnect</p>
      <p class="muted">● Reading src/rail/session-list.tsx</p>
      <p class="muted">● Reading src/server/placement-streams.ts</p>
      <p>The list re-sorts before the snapshot lands. Holding the order until it does.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <p>❯ <i class="cursor"></i></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="app-card chat">
    <div class="who"><span class="mark"><HarnessMark name="codex" /></span><b>Codex</b><small>Chat</small></div>
    <p class="bubble">Add a regression test for the reconnect flicker.</p>
    <p class="reply">Added one: it drops the stream mid-snapshot and checks the order never changes. It passes.</p>
    <p class="tool"><Icon name="check" />Ran 1 test</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .split { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .terminal { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 32rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 2px; padding: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--rail-bg); }
  .tabs > span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--text-weak); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }
  .tabs .active { background: var(--background-base); color: var(--text-strong); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--border); }
  .tabs .session { font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .tab-mark { display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-strong); }
  .screen { padding: 14px 16px 20px; color: var(--text-base); font: 12px/1.6 var(--font-mono); }
  .screen p { margin: 0; }
  .screen b { color: var(--text-strong); font-weight: 500; }
  .muted { color: var(--text-weaker); }
  .path { color: var(--term-path); }
  .cursor { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 14px; vertical-align: -2px; background: var(--text-strong); }
  .chat { position: absolute; top: 40%; left: min(48%, 20rem); width: 17rem; padding: 14px 16px; }
  .who { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .who b { font-weight: 400; }
  .who small { color: var(--text-weaker); font-size: 12px; }
  .mark { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-base-hover); font-size: 14px; }
  .bubble { margin: 0 0 10px auto; width: fit-content; max-width: 90%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bubble-bg); color: var(--text-strong); }
  .reply { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.5; }
  .tool { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 0; color: var(--success); font-size: 12px; }
</style>
